  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Our homeworld all but decimated after the First Contact War and the following inter-Spawnpool territorial disputes, the Skathian people were forced to head outward among the stars. With no real guidance, we blindly groped among the cosmos for a new home. We found many.",
    "value": "第一次接触战争及随后的孵化池间领土争端，令我们的母星几近毁灭，海鳞族被迫向星海迁徙。缺乏明确指引，我们在宇宙中盲目摸索，寻找新的家园，而我们也确实找到了许多。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "While invention was something we'd always excelled at, astronomy was not. Our knowledge of the stars was limited. We are, on the other hand, the most capable undersea species there is and our own architectural style had an advantage: it was already designed for high pressure.",
    "value": "发明创造虽是我们一贯所长，天文学却非其列。我们对星辰的认知本就有限。然而，作为最具适应力的深海物种，我们的建筑风格拥有一项天然优势：它本就为承受高压而设计。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "without much further argument, we began to seed the universe the only way we knew how: By sending mating pairs to as many worlds as possible. Within only three generations, our society went from ironworking to interstellar travel. Imagine where it could take us next?",
    "value": "无需过多争论，我们开始以唯一知晓的方式向宇宙播撒生命：向尽可能多的世界派遣配对个体。仅仅三代之内，我们的社会便从铁器时代迈入了星际航行。试想，下一步又将带我们走向何方？"
  }
